<td>MemFeedback 模块（主动评估）</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Token 优化</td>
<td>context-compressor v1.1（Mermaid 压缩）</td>
<td>声称节省 35.24% Token</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>记忆结构</td>
<td>Episode→Facet→FacetPoint（未完全实现）</td>
